! Kavis — Xft rendering defaults (v0.4-test4 feedback A1)
!
! Debian's /etc/X11/Xsession.d/30x11-common_xresources merges every file
! in this directory into the X resource database at login, before
! ~/.Xresources. Everything that is NOT a GTK application reads its font
! rendering from here: openbox title bars, Qt (Kate), Java, xterm.
! GTK apps get the same values from settings.ini and xsettingsd; the two
! must agree or the title bar and the window content look like different
! systems.
!
! Xft.dpi is the base 96. Settings > Display > Scale overrides it live
! (xrdb -merge) and persists the override in the Kavis block of
! ~/.Xresources, which is merged after this file.

Xft.antialias:  1
Xft.hinting:    1
Xft.hintstyle:  hintslight
Xft.rgba:       rgb
Xft.lcdfilter:  lcddefault
Xft.dpi:        96
